    "Title": "Stop Gang From Destroying ~mission(Objects)",
    "TitleKey": "Headhunters_DefendDestructibleEntites_H_Title_001",
    "DisplayTitle": "Stop Gang From Destroying Fuel Tanks",
    "Description": "Got word from some allies of ours over at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> that they're coming under attack. A gang we've had run-ins with before are trying to take them over by first destroying their <EM4>~mission(Objects)</EM4>.\n\nThis crew are mungers through and through, but they mean business and can handle themselves in a fight. It will take a bit of doing to make sure they don't blow up everything. You might even think about <EM>bringing some help</EM> along.\n\nHandle this right and I\u2019ll give the main contractor <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) Council Scrip</EM4>.\n\n- Stows",
    "DescriptionKey": "Headhunters_DefendDestructibleEntites_H_Desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Got word from some allies of ours over at <EM4>Asteroid Mining Base</EM4> that they're coming under attack. A gang we've had run-ins with before are trying to take them over by first destroying their <EM4>Fuel Tanks</EM4>.\n\nThis crew are mungers through and through, but they mean business and can handle themselves in a fight. It will take a bit of doing to make sure they don't blow up everything. You might even think about <EM>bringing some help</EM> along.\n\nHandle this right and I\u2019ll give the main contractor <EM4>[ScripAmount] Council Scrip</EM4>.\n\n- Stows",
